    {
      "path": "assets/media/leveling-year.mp3",
      "role": "audio",
      "required": false,
      "language": "neutral",
      "title_zh": "一年的声音：同一份工作量，两种落法",
      "title_en": "The sound of one year: the same work, landing two ways",
      "description_zh": "48 秒数据发声（无语音、无音乐素材）：全年 214 小时复测工时按月排开，每一次脉冲代表 2.5 小时。前半段所有周期同月起算，峰值 83.5 小时；后半段把三个年度点分开，峰值降到 31.5 小时——工作量一次没变。全部由正弦振荡器合成，非现场录音，不得作为现状声环境的证据。",
      "description_en": "A 48-second sonification with no speech and no musical material: 214 hours of annual re-survey work laid out month by month, one pulse per 2.5 hours. In the first half every cadence starts in the same month and the peak is 83.5 hours; in the second the three annual readings are separated and the peak falls to 31.5, with no change to the work at all. Synthesised with a sine oscillator, not a recording, and not evidence of the existing acoustic environment.",
      "transcript": "assets/media/leveling-year.md",
      "sha256": "6d575ad25ea2a6c04f1375cfb80144db4fc3eb27be20dd0f2a05d7b23d82b667"
